From f9cbdf493a6e7c98c5ed0a12714cbe9779a58834 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:01:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] refactor(frontend): remove unused exports, types, a
 dependency and two dead prefs; knip gates CI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

knip reported 112 unused exports, 25 unused exported types and one unused
dependency (@tanstack/react-virtual). `knip --fix` dropped the `export`
keyword where the symbol is still used inside its own module (70 cases) and
removed the dependency; the symbols that then had no reader at all were
deleted with a small TypeScript-AST codemod
(scripts/codemods/remove-unused-decls.mjs, kept for reference), iterating
until eslint's no-unused-vars was clean — 37 functions/constants plus the
imports that only fed them. Types that only one module needs are now local.

Also removed:
- `UserPrefs.language`: normalised to the literal "en" and never read.
- The `sessionStorage` "msgcache" entries: written on every cache update,
  never read; only deleted on logout.
- `scripts/export-combined-docs.tsx` is kept — it is a manual docs
  exporter, not dead code (run with a TS runner).

CI: `npm run knip` in frontend-tests-and-build; knip.json now only names
the script entries (Vite/vitest entries are auto-detected).

Verified: eslint 0 errors, tsc clean, knip clean, vitest 224 passed,
vite build ok.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTnpHajSmkk2JMLfuQoV7o
